>周一）</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">—</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">23</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">周日）</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 317.2pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>公示</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考核结果</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 142pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">20</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日前</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">周四）</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 317.2pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班主任</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汇总</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学生所获荣誉（最多两项）</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">完成</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>班主任寄语</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>200字以内</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 300.0%;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 5pt;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>附：绍兴一中学生综合素质考核实施办法</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 5pt;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生综合素质考核结果反映了学生一学期来在综合素质方面的表现，也是学生高校自主招生推荐的重要依据，考核结果受到各方面关注。为公平、公正、规范地做好此项工作，特别修订以下考核办法：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.考核程序：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）学生自评；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）班级综合素质评价工作小组评定；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（3）各项目考评等第主要负责人审核考评；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（4）德育处、团委等相关处室审核；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（5）公示考核结果。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.评价等级比例划分：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">评价结果分三等，用A、B、C表示，分别代表“优秀”、“好”、“尚需努力”。其中：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">品德表现：以班级为单位，每学期各班A等比例26%（创新班35%），C等比例不超过5%。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动健康：以班级为单位，每学期各班A等比例26%，C等比例不超过5%。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">创新实践：以班级为单位，每学期各班A等比例26%（创新班35%），C等比例不超过5%。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">艺术素养：以年段为单位，每学期年段A等比例26%，C等比例不超过5%。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.评价结果说明：</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生综合素质评价各项目考评等第结果由相关项目主要负责人负责。参考该生综合素质评价得分情况以及该生平时表现、相关学科（体育、音乐、美术等）的考核成绩，相关班主任和任课老师对该生的评议，进行综合评定。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.各项目主要负责人</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">品德表现负责人：各班班主任；</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动健康负责人：相关体育老师；</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">艺术素养负责人：相关音乐、美术老师；</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">创新实践负责人：团委、各班班主任；</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各班考评时有下列行为的学生，当学期品德表现不能被评为“A”：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）故意损坏公物；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）早恋倾向；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（3）考试作弊；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（4）沉迷于电子游戏；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（5）受过学校处分尚未撤消；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（6）一学期3次以上违反住校生纪律；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（7）未经德育处审批同意私自带手机；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（8）违规使用自修教室；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（9）一学期无</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">故</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不跑操3次及其以上；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（10）仪容仪表不符合《中学生日常行为规范》；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（11）一学期迟到次数5次以上（含5次）；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（12）一学期3次以上不规范穿着校服（含3次）；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（13）文明习惯、素养有明显欠缺；不文明就餐，有浪费粮食的行为。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（14）处理同学矛盾，有过激不当行为；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（15）无</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">故</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不参加学校集体活动，各项校级比赛（如军体运动会、校运会）；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
